  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "_comment": "Per-family companion manifest for PaRuX media pipelines. Every file name below is taken from the workflow templates in ../config or from docs/audits/parts/image-gen.md. A null source.revision, sizeBytes or sha256 means the value is NOT pinned yet: the resolver reports such a component as manual-install only and the fetch path refuses it. Tensor-name signatures are PaRuX's own reading of the public layouts and are checked only with synthetic headers in tests until validated on real weights. Shared files (same folder and file name in more than one family) must declare identical sources. An optional companion license is the publisher's declared licence for that exact file; leave it out until it has been checked.",
